1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,476
(Previously) How much money
do you have? Hand it all over!

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,500
Phob, watch out!
Don't you dare resist!

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,800
No one will ever find us here.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,999
How about we find time
to meet here again, Your Highness?

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,240
Lately, Tinnakorn has been
going out of town quite often.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,999
I'm so worried about him.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,120
Lately, the Ministry of the Palace has
no official business out of town at all.

8
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,700
A spy reported that two of our soldiers
have been captured.

9
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,000
We must take action to
change the country very soon.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Do you like it? The jeweler made them
specially for the two of us.

11
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,700
I love it.

12
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:05,500
"The Edge of Horizon"
(Episode 7)

13
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,330
Has Tinnakorn left?

14
00:02:12,944 --> 00:02:13,945
Yes, Your Highness.

15
00:02:14,762 --> 00:02:15,850
Do you know where he went?

16
00:02:27,322 --> 00:02:28,610
What are you craving today?

17
00:02:29,664 --> 00:02:30,770
I'm good with anything.

18
00:03:03,850 --> 00:03:05,970
This is the first time
I've been behind the ministry.

19
00:03:07,744 --> 00:03:08,970
The place was dark and gloomy.

20
00:03:12,949 --> 00:03:15,090
They're waiting to submit
petitions to the King

21
00:03:15,850 --> 00:03:18,290
and seek help for the
hardships they're facing.

22
00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:23,170
They're from all over the country.

23
00:03:24,973 --> 00:03:26,770
Some came from Prachin Buri,

24
00:03:27,341 --> 00:03:28,981
while others traveled from the Northeast.

25
00:03:38,938 --> 00:03:40,810
They must have been through a lot.

26
00:05:28,632 --> 00:05:29,930
I am all in.

27
00:05:31,128 --> 00:05:32,301
By the end of June,

28
00:05:32,850 --> 00:05:35,610
I'll get the money I invested back,
plus the interest, right?

29
00:05:37,318 --> 00:05:38,512
Of course, you will.

30
00:05:38,922 --> 00:05:40,762
Don't you remember
the last time you invested?

31
00:05:40,938 --> 00:05:43,210
You doubled your money in just a month.

32
00:05:45,139 --> 00:05:46,140
Good.

33
00:05:46,986 --> 00:05:49,890
If someone finds the documents showing
I withdrew money

34
00:05:49,968 --> 00:05:51,688
from the project budget for something else,

35
00:05:52,378 --> 00:05:53,379
we're screwed.

36
00:05:53,530 --> 00:05:55,250
You can rest assured.

37
00:05:55,645 --> 00:05:59,050
The more we invest,
the higher our returns will be.

38
00:05:59,656 --> 00:06:01,336
I guarantee that by the end of this month,

39
00:06:01,490 --> 00:06:04,710
we'll both be millionaires.

40
00:06:13,581 --> 00:06:14,581
This time,

41
00:06:15,490 --> 00:06:18,629
even after I pay the ministry back,
I'll still make a profit.

42
00:06:19,781 --> 00:06:21,930
I'll buy everything I've ever wanted.

43
00:06:22,058 --> 00:06:23,370
Even my dad

44
00:06:24,290 --> 00:06:25,610
won't be able to keep up with me.

45
00:06:26,938 --> 00:06:28,850
Here's to getting rich!

46
00:06:36,581 --> 00:06:37,810
Let me top off your drink.

47
00:06:58,154 --> 00:06:59,155
You're not hungry?

48
00:07:01,834 --> 00:07:02,835
Not really.

49
00:07:06,816 --> 00:07:09,690
Seeing those people got to you, didn't it?

50
00:07:16,333 --> 00:07:17,690
They barely have anything to eat.

51
00:07:20,154 --> 00:07:21,850
- We shouldn't...
- We shouldn't splurge.

52
00:07:25,370 --> 00:07:26,371
You're right.

53
00:07:26,906 --> 00:07:28,522
What we're doing now is like

54
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:31,970
feasting while they're starving.

55
00:07:39,765 --> 00:07:41,130
That's not what I meant.

56
00:07:43,274 --> 00:07:46,210
Look, I've even ruined the mood for you.

57
00:07:48,554 --> 00:07:50,389
Actually, the economic downturn

58
00:07:51,082 --> 00:07:52,242
is affecting the whole world.

59
00:07:52,906 --> 00:07:54,970
And it's not an easy problem to solve.

60
00:07:56,021 --> 00:07:59,432
All the royals are doing everything
they can to find a solution.

61
00:08:05,752 --> 00:08:07,050
But for those who are suffering,

62
00:08:07,475 --> 00:08:09,410
sick, and hungry,

63
00:08:10,546 --> 00:08:12,226
they can't wait any longer, Your Highness.

64
00:08:12,466 --> 00:08:13,467
I know.

65
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,770
But I simply don't have enough power

66
00:08:16,301 --> 00:08:17,608
to solve these problems.

67
00:08:18,290 --> 00:08:22,530
If anyone can lead this
country out of this crisis,

68
00:08:23,391 --> 00:08:25,170
I'll gladly support them.

69
00:08:32,154 --> 00:08:33,155
Really?

70
00:08:33,621 --> 00:08:37,250
If someone is helping people
overcome their hardships,

71
00:08:38,522 --> 00:08:41,210
you'll support them and
you won't stand in their way.

72
00:08:42,053 --> 00:08:45,232
Also, you won't treat them
as your enemies, will you?

73
00:08:46,597 --> 00:08:47,730
Of course, I won't.

74
00:08:48,762 --> 00:08:50,562
If they're doing what's
best for the country,

75
00:08:50,704 --> 00:08:52,970
I should praise them.

76
00:08:53,237 --> 00:08:54,570
Why would I see them as my enemy?

77
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:57,960
What is going on with you?

78
00:09:01,421 --> 00:09:04,330
My prince is the best.

79
00:09:05,469 --> 00:09:06,470
What?

80
00:09:08,570 --> 00:09:09,571
Phob!

81
00:09:10,317 --> 00:09:11,318
Dad!

82
00:09:23,301 --> 00:09:24,302
Dad!

83
00:09:25,421 --> 00:09:26,422
Prince Vasin!

84
00:09:26,874 --> 00:09:28,615
- Dad!
- Prince Vasin!

85
00:09:31,376 --> 00:09:32,856
What are you going to do to your son?

86
00:09:33,493 --> 00:09:34,850
I should be the one asking you

87
00:09:34,894 --> 00:09:37,008
what you've been trying to
drag my son into this time.

88
00:09:37,032 --> 00:09:38,328
- Huh?
- Please, don't.

89
00:09:38,850 --> 00:09:39,851
Dad!

90
00:09:40,381 --> 00:09:41,490
Are you protecting him?

91
00:09:42,728 --> 00:09:44,544
You said you had to work out of town,

92
00:09:45,154 --> 00:09:47,570
but you were with him
all along, weren't you?

93
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,641
Tell me!

94
00:09:50,394 --> 00:09:51,395
Just tell me!

95
00:09:55,029 --> 00:09:56,030
Actually…

96
00:09:56,093 --> 00:09:57,094
- I...
- Hello.

97
00:09:57,472 --> 00:09:58,973
Hello, Uncle. How are you?

98
00:10:00,736 --> 00:10:01,737
Siri?

99
00:10:05,670 --> 00:10:07,522
I told Tinnakorn to meet me here.

100
00:10:08,365 --> 00:10:10,530
Have you eaten yet, Uncle?

101
00:10:11,192 --> 00:10:12,950
Why don't you join us?

102
00:10:13,448 --> 00:10:15,850
I ordered plenty of food.

103
00:10:19,701 --> 00:10:21,290
Didn't Tinnakorn come with Phobthee?

104
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:25,090
No. Phob came with Janthorn.

105
00:10:25,509 --> 00:10:29,100
I ran into them, so I
invited them to join us.

106
00:10:30,650 --> 00:10:31,770
That's right, Your Highness.

107
00:10:45,373 --> 00:10:49,090
You're lucky Janthorn and
I showed up just in time.

108
00:10:49,973 --> 00:10:51,989
Siri, thank you so much.

109
00:10:53,029 --> 00:10:56,450
If there's anything I can help
you two with, just let me know.

110
00:10:57,250 --> 00:10:58,251
Actually,

111
00:11:00,346 --> 00:11:02,373
Phob and I…

112
00:11:03,077 --> 00:11:04,450
I know

113
00:11:04,698 --> 00:11:07,100
you and Phob share a very special bond.

114
00:11:09,170 --> 00:11:10,410
Siri, I'm so sorry.

115
00:11:11,426 --> 00:11:13,272
You don't have to apologize to me.

116
00:11:13,696 --> 00:11:16,250
I know how hard it is to
live by the rules of your rank

117
00:11:16,429 --> 00:11:19,290
and carry the burden
of your family's honor.

118
00:11:21,192 --> 00:11:22,700
I truly wish

119
00:11:23,032 --> 00:11:25,610
you and Phob all the
happiness in the world.

120
00:11:26,077 --> 00:11:28,090
May the two of you finally be together.

121
00:11:28,413 --> 00:11:32,930
I'm happy just to be your sister.

122
00:11:34,493 --> 00:11:35,494
Siri.

123
00:11:38,290 --> 00:11:39,570
Thank you so much,

124
00:11:41,514 --> 00:11:42,690
my lovely sister.

125
00:11:45,770 --> 00:11:47,290
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

126
00:11:51,797 --> 00:11:53,810
- Where are you going?
- To Varakulvatin Palace.

127
00:11:53,893 --> 00:11:56,133
I'm worried his father will beat him
the way he beat me.

128
00:11:56,566 --> 00:11:57,810
You need to get it together!

129
00:12:00,098 --> 00:12:02,298
You'll only make things worse
if you show up like this!

130
00:12:07,285 --> 00:12:11,245
Is this why you don't want to pry
information out of Prince Tinnakorn?

131
00:12:23,498 --> 00:12:24,499
Tinnakorn.

132
00:12:33,098 --> 00:12:34,099
Yes, Dad?

133
00:12:36,016 --> 00:12:38,410
So, you really have a
date with Siri, don't you?

134
00:12:40,074 --> 00:12:41,930
I was just about to talk to you about her.

135
00:12:43,488 --> 00:12:44,489
What is it?

136
00:12:45,786 --> 00:12:47,466
I'd like to call off my engagement to her.

137
00:12:49,069 --> 00:12:50,290
What were you thinking?

138
00:12:50,770 --> 00:12:52,210
Have you lost your mind?

139
00:12:54,130 --> 00:12:55,290
You're willing to leave

140
00:12:55,602 --> 00:12:57,970
a wonderful woman like her because of Phob?

141
00:12:58,082 --> 00:12:59,890
It's because she's such a wonderful woman

142
00:13:00,136 --> 00:13:01,810
that she shouldn't waste her time on me.

143
00:13:03,678 --> 00:13:07,170
You know it well that
I can't be a good husband to her.

144
00:13:08,034 --> 00:13:09,035
So what?

145
00:13:09,912 --> 00:13:11,653
What's your plan after
calling off the engagement?

146
00:13:11,677 --> 00:13:12,917
Are you going to live with him?

147
00:13:13,698 --> 00:13:14,970
Wake up already!

148
00:13:16,250 --> 00:13:18,530
Nobody can accept you for who you are.

149
00:13:19,730 --> 00:13:22,850
You will ruin our family's reputation.

150
00:13:23,032 --> 00:13:24,650
Ruin the family's reputation?

151
00:13:26,730 --> 00:13:29,090
I've always done everything
you've asked of me.

152
00:13:30,237 --> 00:13:31,890
I studied what you wanted me to study.

153
00:13:32,721 --> 00:13:34,241
I pursued the career you chose for me.

154
00:13:34,850 --> 00:13:36,458
I've always upheld our family's reputation.

155
00:13:36,482 --> 00:13:38,550
What else do I have to do to satisfy you?

156
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:40,010
Be the man!

157
00:13:42,050 --> 00:13:44,290
Be like every other man.

158
00:13:45,652 --> 00:13:47,770
Get married and have children

159
00:13:48,621 --> 00:13:49,970
to carry on our family's legacy.

160
00:13:51,112 --> 00:13:52,890
Stop living in a fantasy world

161
00:13:52,994 --> 00:13:54,914
and stop doing those
disgusting things with him.

162
00:13:56,306 --> 00:13:57,946
If anyone finds out about the two of you,

163
00:13:58,013 --> 00:14:01,370
our family will become
the laughingstock of the entire city.

164
00:14:10,173 --> 00:14:11,174
You're right.

165
00:14:14,045 --> 00:14:16,650
I must have humiliated you.

166
00:14:20,026 --> 00:14:21,210
What about this?

167
00:14:24,498 --> 00:14:26,650
Then disown me. Strip
me of our family name,

168
00:14:27,632 --> 00:14:30,490
and forget that you ever
had this disgraceful son.

169
00:14:30,517 --> 00:14:32,680
- Tinnakorn!
- What is it?

170
00:14:32,768 --> 00:14:34,130
Vasin!

171
00:14:34,426 --> 00:14:36,970
Are you going to hit your son?

172
00:14:39,378 --> 00:14:41,650
I don't care what you want.

173
00:14:42,274 --> 00:14:44,370
You're still going to marry Ruethaisiri.

174
00:15:16,992 --> 00:15:18,170
Vasin?

175
00:15:20,282 --> 00:15:21,283
Mom?

176
00:15:22,192 --> 00:15:25,712
Did you and Tinnakorn
argue about Ruethaisiri?

177
00:15:29,050 --> 00:15:30,450
Don't you worry.

178
00:15:31,472 --> 00:15:34,250
He will have to marry Ruethaisiri.

179
00:15:36,232 --> 00:15:38,490
I'll speak to Ruethaisiri's father

180
00:15:38,813 --> 00:15:40,813
and have the wedding
arranged as soon as possible.

181
00:15:41,933 --> 00:15:45,433
When you build a house, you build it
for the people who are going to live in it.

182
00:15:45,810 --> 00:15:48,050
If he doesn't love her,

183
00:15:48,298 --> 00:15:50,400
you shouldn't force him to marry her.

184
00:15:51,109 --> 00:15:54,290
Ruethaisiri is the perfect match for him.

185
00:15:54,362 --> 00:15:56,690
But Tinnakorn is a good man.

186
00:15:56,821 --> 00:15:58,792
He has a good heart and a
good head on his shoulders.

187
00:15:58,816 --> 00:16:03,301
I believe he'll choose the
right woman for himself.

188
00:16:03,973 --> 00:16:07,610
After all, it's his life.
You need to let him make his own decisions.

189
00:16:09,277 --> 00:16:11,550
This is the only thing
that I can't let him.

190
00:16:11,704 --> 00:16:12,900
Why's that?

191
00:16:16,754 --> 00:16:19,890
Tinnakorn is the pride
and honor of the Varakulvatin family.

192
00:16:20,696 --> 00:16:22,570
He's my greatest pride,

193
00:16:22,981 --> 00:16:25,090
and he should always remain that way.

194
00:16:26,176 --> 00:16:31,196
Tinnakorn should be a prince
whom people respect and admire.

195
00:16:32,322 --> 00:16:35,845
He shouldn't turn into an
object of ridicule and contempt.

196
00:16:36,053 --> 00:16:37,450
I have to protect him.

197
00:16:37,578 --> 00:16:39,810
What are you talking
about? What is going on?

198
00:16:40,101 --> 00:16:43,850
It's not that big of a deal.

199
00:16:44,202 --> 00:16:46,810
It's just that Tin doesn't
want to get married.

200
00:17:01,288 --> 00:17:02,289
What is this?

201
00:17:02,890 --> 00:17:05,850
Why is the pension disbursement
for the Department of Mineral Resources

202
00:17:06,170 --> 00:17:08,850
taking so long? What's holding it up?

203
00:17:11,672 --> 00:17:15,010
There were some issues with the paperwork.

204
00:17:16,370 --> 00:17:17,730
Hurry up and fix it.

205
00:17:18,366 --> 00:17:22,450
The Minister will be here to inspect
it himself at the end of the month.

206
00:17:24,824 --> 00:17:25,825
Yes, sir.

207
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:37,410
Could you help speed up the
coal mine dividend payment?

208
00:17:37,970 --> 00:17:41,530
There's going to be a major
audit at the end of the month.

209
00:17:41,618 --> 00:17:43,258
If the Minister finds
out I've taken the money,

210
00:17:43,282 --> 00:17:45,610
we'll both end up In jail.

211
00:17:46,128 --> 00:17:48,690
Sure, sir. I will speed it up for you.

212
00:17:48,832 --> 00:17:52,290
Don't you worry. I never
broke your promise.

213
00:17:52,586 --> 00:17:53,850
Come on, let's drink.

214
00:17:55,026 --> 00:17:56,370
Let's have a drink with me.

215
00:18:08,021 --> 00:18:09,410
Don't stress. It will be fine.

216
00:18:55,776 --> 00:18:56,986
We don't have much time.

217
00:18:57,461 --> 00:19:00,950
If we leave this too long,
I'm afraid they might uncover something.

218
00:19:01,501 --> 00:19:03,610
We have to act to change this country soon.

219
00:19:03,885 --> 00:19:06,210
Otherwise, we may never get another chance.

220
00:20:15,650 --> 00:20:17,651
[June 22, 1932]

221
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,601
Phob?

222
00:20:27,008 --> 00:20:28,768
Have you received the
official schedule yet?

223
00:20:30,689 --> 00:20:31,690
Yeah.

224
00:20:31,954 --> 00:20:34,626
I made a copy, and
I'll give it to Mr. Kitti.

225
00:20:38,066 --> 00:20:39,546
I haven't heard from Prince Tinnakorn

226
00:20:39,981 --> 00:20:41,650
since the incident at the restaurant.

227
00:20:43,954 --> 00:20:45,730
This is for our country and people.

228
00:20:46,525 --> 00:20:49,850
When that day comes,
he will understand you.

229
00:21:14,378 --> 00:21:15,978
Thank you for the information, Phobthee.

230
00:21:16,992 --> 00:21:18,650
This is the right time for us.

231
00:21:20,176 --> 00:21:21,370
What do you mean?

232
00:21:22,682 --> 00:21:24,370
The 115 members of the Army, the Navy,

233
00:21:24,613 --> 00:21:27,170
and the civilian sector
have unanimously agreed

234
00:21:28,453 --> 00:21:30,413
that we should carry out
the change in government

235
00:21:31,173 --> 00:21:33,100
on Friday, June 24.

236
00:21:34,512 --> 00:21:35,513
The next two days?

237
00:21:35,589 --> 00:21:36,590
That's right.

238
00:21:37,350 --> 00:21:39,970
We don't know when those two
who were arrested might talk.

239
00:21:40,696 --> 00:21:41,930
We have to make our move now.

240
00:21:42,362 --> 00:21:44,570
This will be our last meeting.

241
00:21:46,040 --> 00:21:49,090
We won't meet again until
the day we make our move.

242
00:21:49,672 --> 00:21:52,690
So pay close attention to the plan.

243
00:21:56,709 --> 00:21:57,710
This moment

244
00:21:58,210 --> 00:22:00,290
is the most crucial time.

245
00:22:15,728 --> 00:22:17,610
This is the most precarious moment.

246
00:22:18,357 --> 00:22:20,130
The Commander General of the 1st Division,

247
00:22:20,610 --> 00:22:22,690
one of our key forces,

248
00:22:23,173 --> 00:22:26,530
has been assigned to visit Ratchaburi
and the southern provinces.

249
00:22:26,986 --> 00:22:28,570
He won't return until next month.

250
00:22:29,250 --> 00:22:31,730
Besides, many of the Navy's
senior officers are on leave.

251
00:22:32,581 --> 00:22:36,330
That means we're the
only ones left in the capital.

252
00:22:38,938 --> 00:22:41,450
If anyone intended to
overthrow the government,

253
00:22:42,082 --> 00:22:44,042
they'd seize this opportunity
without hesitation.

254
00:22:53,066 --> 00:22:55,690
Your Highness, my informants report that

255
00:22:56,186 --> 00:22:58,810
military and civil officers
who studied in France

256
00:22:59,269 --> 00:23:02,090
have been openly meeting
with mid-ranking officials.

257
00:23:05,978 --> 00:23:07,458
They must be speeding up their plans.

258
00:23:08,906 --> 00:23:10,810
We have to force those two soldiers

259
00:23:11,024 --> 00:23:13,490
to give up the names of
everyone in the movement.

260
00:23:25,210 --> 00:23:26,211
Aum.

261
00:23:26,250 --> 00:23:27,251
Yes?

262
00:23:27,674 --> 00:23:28,770
Is it for Tinnakorn?

263
00:23:29,173 --> 00:23:30,174
Yes, Your Highness.

264
00:23:30,701 --> 00:23:31,702
I'll bring it to him.

265
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,681
Tinnakorn.

266
00:23:47,512 --> 00:23:48,513
Hey, it's me.

267
00:25:52,178 --> 00:25:53,179
Phob?

268
00:25:55,416 --> 00:25:56,417
What's wrong?

269
00:26:00,386 --> 00:26:02,570
I waited up for you until I fell asleep.

270
00:26:04,509 --> 00:26:05,510
I didn't think

271
00:26:06,498 --> 00:26:09,250
your dad would ever let you out again.

272
00:26:13,578 --> 00:26:14,950
I'm not a kid anymore.

273
00:26:16,762 --> 00:26:18,602
If he wouldn't let me
out, I'd just sneak out.

274
00:26:19,312 --> 00:26:20,432
I knew you'd come to see me.

275
00:26:22,773 --> 00:26:24,490
My prince is the best.

276
00:26:31,176 --> 00:26:33,272
Is something bothering you?

277
00:26:36,514 --> 00:26:37,650
You can tell me.

278
00:26:39,677 --> 00:26:40,678
Come on.

279
00:27:08,474 --> 00:27:09,490
Can you wait for me here

280
00:27:11,234 --> 00:27:12,810
for the next two days?

281
00:27:16,202 --> 00:27:17,203
What is going on?

282
00:27:20,826 --> 00:27:22,546
I have something important to take care of.

283
00:27:25,296 --> 00:27:26,810
If you stay here and wait for me,

284
00:27:28,157 --> 00:27:29,490
it'll put my mind at ease.

285
00:27:31,170 --> 00:27:32,330
Something important?

286
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:36,538
What is it? Can I help you?

287
00:27:37,701 --> 00:27:39,330
I can help you with anything.

288
00:27:39,450 --> 00:27:41,250
You can let me know

289
00:27:41,722 --> 00:27:42,930
about your important mission.

290
00:27:43,568 --> 00:27:45,408
I don't want to see
you so stressed like this.

291
00:27:46,010 --> 00:27:47,011
You know?

292
00:27:52,550 --> 00:27:55,288
I can help you with anything.

293
00:28:03,258 --> 00:28:04,930
Just being here is good enough for me.

294
00:28:07,136 --> 00:28:08,137
There is one thing.

295
00:28:10,610 --> 00:28:11,970
I'd like you to know.

296
00:28:19,005 --> 00:28:20,010
Whatever happens

297
00:28:22,290 --> 00:28:23,730
from now on,

298
00:28:27,069 --> 00:28:28,450
please remember one thing,

299
00:28:32,210 --> 00:28:34,170
I never meant to hurt you.

300
00:28:52,389 --> 00:28:53,450
I love you.

301
00:28:54,858 --> 00:28:55,879
I love you so much.

302
00:28:58,517 --> 00:28:59,900
I love you more than anything.

303
00:29:00,362 --> 00:29:02,350
- Phob?
- More than my own life.

304
00:29:03,024 --> 00:29:04,025
What is going on?

305
00:29:05,210 --> 00:29:06,330
Why are you...

306
00:29:11,416 --> 00:29:12,417
Phob?

307
00:30:27,450 --> 00:30:30,210
[June 23, 1932]

308
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:40,761
What's the update?

309
00:30:40,944 --> 00:30:41,945
I've got a lead.

310
00:30:41,962 --> 00:30:43,850
I know where your son is.

311
00:31:10,093 --> 00:31:11,094
Please wait for me here

312
00:31:12,517 --> 00:31:13,900
tomorrow.

313
00:31:15,082 --> 00:31:16,083
Do not leave this house.

314
00:31:17,747 --> 00:31:20,027
You keep saying that,
and I'm starting to get scared.

315
00:31:21,120 --> 00:31:22,250
What is happening tomorrow?

316
00:31:29,664 --> 00:31:30,665
I'll tell you everything

317
00:31:31,797 --> 00:31:33,100
when it is done.

318
00:31:34,560 --> 00:31:35,560
Okay?

319
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,720
Come back soon. I'll be waiting here.

320
00:32:06,338 --> 00:32:07,450
I'll wait for you here.

321
00:32:57,229 --> 00:32:58,230
Is that Phob?

322
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,010
Did he forget something?

323
00:33:07,858 --> 00:33:08,859
Dad?

324
00:33:11,037 --> 00:33:13,250
Did you really think I
wouldn't be able to find you?

325
00:33:13,757 --> 00:33:14,758
Go home!

326
00:33:15,266 --> 00:33:17,560
I'm not going home
with you. I will stay here.

327
00:33:18,810 --> 00:33:19,811
Hey!

328
00:33:20,424 --> 00:33:21,970
You think you have a choice?

329
00:33:22,509 --> 00:33:23,629
Come here and take him home!

330
00:33:23,736 --> 00:33:25,056
- Yes, Your Highness.
- No! I'm not going.

331
00:33:25,080 --> 00:33:26,081
Dad!

332
00:33:27,410 --> 00:33:28,411
Let me go!

333
00:33:28,696 --> 00:33:29,697
Dad!

334
00:33:30,184 --> 00:33:32,950
I will stay here! You can't bring me home!

335
00:33:33,950 --> 00:33:36,410
I will stay here!

336
00:33:45,530 --> 00:33:46,531
Stay here!

337
00:33:47,037 --> 00:33:48,850
And you won't see him again!

338
00:33:49,570 --> 00:33:50,571
Do it!

339
00:33:52,490 --> 00:33:53,691
Go ahead and lock me up!

340
00:33:55,391 --> 00:33:57,490
As long as I'm alive,

341
00:33:58,032 --> 00:33:59,626
I'll find a way to get out and see him.

342
00:34:00,133 --> 00:34:01,134
Tinnakorn!

343
00:34:02,874 --> 00:34:04,490
What has he done to you?

344
00:34:05,856 --> 00:34:09,090
What happened to the
son I was once so proud of?

345
00:34:09,162 --> 00:34:10,491
I've never changed, Dad.

346
00:34:12,245 --> 00:34:13,650
This is who I am.

347
00:34:15,550 --> 00:34:17,850
I just want to be with someone I love.

348
00:34:19,258 --> 00:34:21,090
That's all I've ever wanted.

349
00:34:22,010 --> 00:34:25,056
Is it that bad?

350
00:34:26,202 --> 00:34:28,912
Your life isn't yours alone.

351
00:34:30,050 --> 00:34:32,610
You are the honor of this family.

352
00:34:33,205 --> 00:34:34,611
The honor?

353
00:34:36,682 --> 00:34:40,650
If having that honor
means living without Phob,

354
00:34:42,293 --> 00:34:43,810
then I don't want it.

355
00:34:45,658 --> 00:34:48,550
Honor has never made me happy.

356
00:34:50,050 --> 00:34:52,090
All it's ever brought me is misery.

357
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:55,410
All it's ever given me is a burden.

358
00:34:57,032 --> 00:34:59,250
I just want to be free.

359
00:35:00,850 --> 00:35:03,050
I just want to be with the man I love.

360
00:35:04,490 --> 00:35:08,370
That's the only thing I've ever wanted in my
life. I'll never ask you for anything ever again.

361
00:35:09,850 --> 00:35:11,637
Can you give it to me?

362
00:35:12,714 --> 00:35:15,210
Stop being so shallow!

363
00:35:17,312 --> 00:35:19,586
Do you really think that
kind of twisted and distorted love

364
00:35:19,610 --> 00:35:21,490
will ever make you happy?

365
00:35:21,909 --> 00:35:24,250
You'll be looked down on,

366
00:35:24,415 --> 00:35:25,616
ridiculed, and laughed at.

367
00:35:26,750 --> 00:35:28,950
You'll be forced to live,
and you'd wish you were dead.

368
00:35:29,770 --> 00:35:31,090
Live a life worse than death?

369
00:35:33,890 --> 00:35:35,290
It's not different from now, is it?

370
00:35:37,050 --> 00:35:40,370
You're killing me from the inside!

371
00:35:49,237 --> 00:35:50,850
Was that necessary?

372
00:36:01,333 --> 00:36:02,334
Dad!

373
00:36:03,581 --> 00:36:04,770
Please, I beg you.

374
00:36:06,519 --> 00:36:08,650
Can I live with Phob?

375
00:36:11,175 --> 00:36:14,095
Please, let me live with him.

376
00:36:15,640 --> 00:36:17,010
I love him.

377
00:36:21,592 --> 00:36:23,570
Do you know how hard it was for me

378
00:36:24,736 --> 00:36:26,450
to live day by day

379
00:36:27,112 --> 00:36:29,350
when he wasn't around?

380
00:36:31,773 --> 00:36:34,771
When he came back into my life,

381
00:36:36,330 --> 00:36:39,250
I finally realized what
true happiness felt like.

382
00:36:42,050 --> 00:36:45,730
I finally remembered
what it felt like to smile.

383
00:36:47,330 --> 00:36:48,850
Please, I beg you.

384
00:36:49,917 --> 00:36:52,650
Can't you just let me be happy?

385
00:36:55,128 --> 00:36:57,150
Could you give me that?

386
00:37:03,912 --> 00:37:06,930
This is the only thing
I'll ever ask of you.

387
00:37:21,870 --> 00:37:24,482
And that's the one thing I can't give you.

388
00:38:50,514 --> 00:38:51,515
Your Highness,

389
00:38:54,285 --> 00:38:55,286
what are you doing here?

390
00:38:57,821 --> 00:38:59,050
I'm getting some fresh air.

391
00:39:02,879 --> 00:39:04,100
I am so happy.

392
00:39:07,650 --> 00:39:09,050
I want to live like this forever.

393
00:39:14,266 --> 00:39:15,490
Why won't you?

394
00:39:17,434 --> 00:39:19,130
We will live like this

395
00:39:21,550 --> 00:39:23,010
and we will be happy like this

396
00:39:23,770 --> 00:39:24,771
forever.

397
00:39:45,550 --> 00:39:46,551
What are you looking at?

398
00:39:46,650 --> 00:39:47,690
I'm watching the moon.

399
00:39:51,590 --> 00:39:54,290
It's a full moon tonight.
I haven't seen one in a long time.

400
00:39:57,986 --> 00:39:58,987
It's pretty, isn't it?

401
00:40:05,562 --> 00:40:06,563
It is.

402
00:40:11,466 --> 00:40:14,570
I'll do whatever it
takes to get back to you.

403
00:40:26,861 --> 00:40:27,862
Grandma?

404
00:40:40,754 --> 00:40:41,755
Tin.

405
00:40:42,941 --> 00:40:47,142
What is going on between you and Phob?

406
00:40:48,930 --> 00:40:49,931
I…

407
00:40:52,750 --> 00:40:53,970
I overheard

408
00:40:55,506 --> 00:40:57,730
your argument with your father.

409
00:41:01,944 --> 00:41:03,592
Is it true?

410
00:41:04,269 --> 00:41:05,709
- Grandma, I...
- About you and Phob?

411
00:41:08,050 --> 00:41:09,051
Grandma, I...

412
00:41:10,434 --> 00:41:13,138
Please forgive me for
causing you so much sorrow, Grandma.

413
00:41:14,253 --> 00:41:16,090
Is it the reason

414
00:41:18,150 --> 00:41:19,950
that Nual and Phob

415
00:41:21,029 --> 00:41:23,525
needed to leave the palace?

416
00:41:25,597 --> 00:41:26,598
That's right.

417
00:41:28,077 --> 00:41:30,424
Please don't be mad at Phob.

418
00:41:30,861 --> 00:41:32,296
This is my fault.

419
00:41:34,082 --> 00:41:36,130
It is all my fault.

420
00:41:36,962 --> 00:41:40,490
Please forgive me for
disappointing you, Grandma.

421
00:41:40,510 --> 00:41:42,330
I'm sorry.

422
00:41:43,016 --> 00:41:44,290
I know

423
00:41:44,797 --> 00:41:47,050
my mistake is far too great to forgive.

424
00:41:50,285 --> 00:41:52,850
From now on, I won't
show my face to you again.

425
00:42:05,821 --> 00:42:10,292
Everything I have of value is in here.

426
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:12,610
I want you to have it all.

427
00:42:13,722 --> 00:42:15,122
Take it, build a life for yourself,

428
00:42:15,898 --> 00:42:18,261
and be with the one you love.

429
00:42:20,645 --> 00:42:21,893
Here, take it all.

430
00:42:22,016 --> 00:42:23,730
You're not mad at me?

431
00:42:24,176 --> 00:42:26,330
Why would I be mad at you?

432
00:42:27,616 --> 00:42:30,600
You just want to live your own life.

433
00:42:33,526 --> 00:42:36,450
But I've brought shame upon the our family.

434
00:42:38,997 --> 00:42:41,106
Varakulvatin's reputation
will be ruined because of me.

435
00:42:41,130 --> 00:42:43,930
I've brought our family to ruin, Grandma.

436
00:42:55,834 --> 00:42:56,835
Tinnakorn,

437
00:42:58,026 --> 00:42:59,210
listen to me.

438
00:43:00,765 --> 00:43:03,210
If honor and dignity

439
00:43:04,136 --> 00:43:07,250
must come at the cost

440
00:43:07,421 --> 00:43:10,850
of my grandchildren's suffering and pain,

441
00:43:12,210 --> 00:43:13,810
then I don’t want any part of them.

442
00:43:15,933 --> 00:43:16,934
Grandma.

443
00:43:17,778 --> 00:43:19,050
It's okay.

444
00:43:23,766 --> 00:43:26,498
It's gonna be okay.

445
00:43:27,789 --> 00:43:28,790
Listen to me,

446
00:43:30,066 --> 00:43:33,160
you have to stay strong from now on.

447
00:43:33,938 --> 00:43:35,210
You have to be with Phob.

448
00:43:36,359 --> 00:43:38,210
Don't worry about us here.

449
00:43:39,773 --> 00:43:41,890
I will talk to your dad.

450
00:43:42,434 --> 00:43:44,410
Wait until your dad has calmed down

451
00:43:44,717 --> 00:43:46,541
and his anger has eased.

452
00:43:46,925 --> 00:43:48,312
Then I will tell you

453
00:43:49,506 --> 00:43:53,900
to bring Phob back so the two of you
can ask for his forgiveness, okay?

454
00:43:57,890 --> 00:43:58,891
You should go.

455
00:44:06,925 --> 00:44:07,926
Just go, darling.

456
00:44:08,626 --> 00:44:11,516
- You promise?
- Sure, just go.

457
00:44:19,530 --> 00:44:21,810
May the heavens and all the holy spirits

458
00:44:23,970 --> 00:44:25,930
please watch over and protect

459
00:44:26,680 --> 00:44:29,970
my beloved grandson.

460
00:44:36,403 --> 00:44:41,370
[The dawn of June 24th, 1932.]
[Siamese Revolution]

461
00:44:43,393 --> 00:44:46,810
We'll gather as many troops
as possible at the Royal Plaza.

462
00:44:47,482 --> 00:44:50,882
Some will be brought in from the Royal Military
Academy and the Army Engineer Regiment.

463
00:44:50,906 --> 00:44:52,906
I'll tell them that it is
for a training exercise.

464
00:44:55,050 --> 00:44:58,170
As for the rest, I'll tell
them there's been a riot.

465
00:45:04,642 --> 00:45:07,170
I thought you said there was a riot.
Why isn't anyone here?

466
00:45:07,608 --> 00:45:08,970
But once they're here,

467
00:45:09,394 --> 00:45:11,834
they'll have no choice
but to obey their commanding officers.

468
00:45:14,290 --> 00:45:15,950
Everyone, stay calm.

469
00:45:18,242 --> 00:45:19,970
This is not the time to ask questions.

470
00:45:21,290 --> 00:45:23,570
Listen only to your
commanding officer's orders.

471
00:45:32,568 --> 00:45:35,648
The moment the operation begins, we'll
cut all telephone and telegraph lines.

472
00:45:37,989 --> 00:45:40,440
- The royals and high-ranking officers who
are out of the capital - [Noppalak Palace]

473
00:45:40,464 --> 00:45:42,290
won't be able to communicate or interfere.

474
00:45:45,893 --> 00:45:46,894
After today,

475
00:45:48,421 --> 00:45:50,400
nothing will ever be the same.

476
00:46:06,402 --> 00:46:10,010
From the list of names those two gave us,

477
00:46:10,456 --> 00:46:12,576
there isn't a single
high-ranking officer among them,

478
00:46:13,490 --> 00:46:17,020
or anyone in command of
any significant military force.

479
00:46:17,506 --> 00:46:20,957
Can they truly carry out
a change of government?

480
00:46:22,824 --> 00:46:24,050
We can't be too prepared.

481
00:46:25,210 --> 00:46:27,050
They were all educated in France.

482
00:46:27,802 --> 00:46:29,842
If they're truly intent on
changing the government,

483
00:46:30,928 --> 00:46:33,010
they could be far more
dangerous than we expect.

484
00:46:35,234 --> 00:46:36,794
Has the arrest warrant been issued yet?

485
00:46:36,834 --> 00:46:39,550
The Director-General said
it would be ready by 11.

486
00:46:47,848 --> 00:46:48,890
Who the hell are you?

487
00:46:50,781 --> 00:46:53,410
Do you know the penalty
for invading the palace?

488
00:47:03,730 --> 00:47:04,731
Phob!

489
00:47:06,637 --> 00:47:07,970
Please remain calm, everyone.

490
00:47:09,544 --> 00:47:11,821
As of this moment, Khana Ratsadon

491
00:47:13,010 --> 00:47:15,210
has taken control of
the government already.

492
00:47:21,098 --> 00:47:24,490
We have no intention of harming anyone.

493
00:47:25,600 --> 00:47:26,770
If anyone chooses to resist,

494
00:47:29,296 --> 00:47:31,130
we will act decisively.

495
00:47:50,720 --> 00:47:52,850
This is an announcement
from Khana Ratsadon.

496
00:47:57,130 --> 00:47:58,490
The government has filled

497
00:47:59,074 --> 00:48:01,450
key positions with relatives

498
00:48:02,194 --> 00:48:04,290
and unqualified sycophants.

499
00:48:05,560 --> 00:48:09,890
They have allowed officials
to abuse their authority for personal gain.

500
00:48:10,778 --> 00:48:13,330
Bribes are taken in public
construction projects

501
00:48:13,877 --> 00:48:16,250
and government procurement.

502
00:48:17,878 --> 00:48:21,690
Profits are made through currency exchange,
while the nation's wealth is squandered.

503
00:48:23,210 --> 00:48:27,450
They have elevated their own circle, granting
them privileges above those of the people.

504
00:48:28,050 --> 00:48:30,100
They have oppressed the people,

505
00:48:30,850 --> 00:48:33,011
governed without sound principles,

506
00:48:33,530 --> 00:48:36,290
and left the nation to drift aimlessly,

507
00:48:36,525 --> 00:48:39,930
as evidenced by the economic decline

508
00:48:40,221 --> 00:48:43,170
and the increasing
hardship of making a living,

509
00:48:44,290 --> 00:48:47,950
as the people are already well aware.

510
00:48:50,944 --> 00:48:54,290
People of Siam,

511
00:48:54,930 --> 00:48:58,550
let it be known that this
nation belongs to the people.

512
00:49:01,999 --> 00:49:04,890
We hereby announce to all the people

513
00:49:05,253 --> 00:49:09,892
that the Kingdom of Siam
has changed its system of government.

514
00:49:10,328 --> 00:49:14,730
The authority to govern the nation
now belongs to the people.

515
00:49:14,984 --> 00:49:18,930
Khana Ratsadon has secured control of
all government offices

516
00:49:19,061 --> 00:49:22,050
and has taken the members
of the Royal Family into custody.

517
00:49:22,629 --> 00:49:25,890
We ask all the people not to be alarmed

518
00:49:26,074 --> 00:49:29,890
and to work together to
preserve the peace of the nation.

519
00:49:35,202 --> 00:49:36,850
How did this happen?

520
00:49:44,634 --> 00:49:48,410
Therefore, the people,
the government officials,

521
00:49:48,944 --> 00:49:51,210
along with military and civilian officials

522
00:49:51,924 --> 00:49:56,730
who saw through the
government's corrupt conduct,

523
00:49:57,261 --> 00:50:00,410
joined together to form the
People's Party (Khana Ratsadon)

524
00:50:00,888 --> 00:50:04,050
and have now taken over
the powers of the King.

525
00:50:16,421 --> 00:50:17,422
I can't believe it!

526
00:50:18,210 --> 00:50:19,330
What's going on?

527
00:50:19,938 --> 00:50:21,810
Your Highness! Your Highness!

528
00:50:22,130 --> 00:50:23,131
Your Highness!

529
00:50:25,053 --> 00:50:26,054
Your Highness!

530
00:50:26,221 --> 00:50:29,330
A rally is now taking
place at the Royal Plaza.

531
00:50:29,949 --> 00:50:32,370
People who have suffered
under the government's failures

532
00:50:32,605 --> 00:50:33,730
are called to gether there.

533
00:50:34,210 --> 00:50:37,731
This will be the first time the
people's voices truly matter.

534
00:50:42,330 --> 00:50:44,690
Stand together. Siam is about to change.

535
00:50:48,530 --> 00:50:51,730
This is for people's rights and freedom.

536
00:50:53,210 --> 00:50:54,450
Siam is about to change.

537
00:51:03,117 --> 00:51:07,610
Khana Ratsadon believes that
these injustices can only be corrected

538
00:51:07,816 --> 00:51:12,010
by establishing a system of government
with a legislative assembly,

539
00:51:12,290 --> 00:51:15,450
where many opinions
may be brought together in deliberation,

540
00:51:15,640 --> 00:51:17,960
for the wisdom of many is better than
the judgment of one.

541
00:51:53,500 --> 00:51:55,799
(Next Episode) I wish we could
stay like this together forever.

542
00:51:55,800 --> 00:51:57,999
Of course. As long as Your Highness
doesn't let go of my hand,

543
00:51:58,000 --> 00:52:00,000
I will never let go of yours.

544
00:52:03,000 --> 00:52:06,000
As long as I am alive,
you two will never be together!

545
00:52:06,800 --> 00:52:08,999
- P' Chat!
- Help! Somebody help me!

546
00:52:09,000 --> 00:52:10,799
We haven't even met Phob yet,
and trouble has already struck.

547
00:52:10,800 --> 00:52:12,440
I'll go tell Phob so he can come help us.

548
00:52:13,200 --> 00:52:17,700
In the end... is what I
chose really worth it?
